				<div class="et_pb_code_inner"><div class="azc"><h2>Additional Work That Can Increase the Price</h2><p>Some homes need extra work to get a new system installed correctly. These are potential additional charges, not costs every installation will require.</p> <table><thead><tr><th>Additional work</th><th>Estimated cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Full ductwork replacement</strong></td><td class="azc-price">$1,500–$6,000</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Duct repairs or modifications</strong></td><td class="azc-price">$500–$3,000</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Electrical upgrades</strong></td><td class="azc-price">$500–$2,000</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Permits and inspections</strong></td><td class="azc-price">$75–$500</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Ductwork problems are one of the biggest swings in total cost. Learn more about our <a href="/air-duct-repair-replacement/">air duct repair and replacement</a> services.</p> </div></div>
